{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steal the Pig!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As two sneaky thieves, your mission is to steal the pig. But be careful\u2014this pig isn't a fan of traveling! Try not to damage it or let it escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/1.gif?t=1742839923\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer: Team Up to Steal the Pig!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite a trusted friend to your lobby and work together to steal the pig and deliver it safely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/2.gif?t=1742839923\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Traps &amp; Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you'll encounter tricky traps and brain-teasing puzzles that will test your skills and reflexes. Solve challenges and avoid dangers to successfully deliver the pig!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/3.gif?t=1742839923\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Physics at Every Step</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything in this game follows real physics\u2014mass, inertia, collisions\u2014all of it matters! This makes every moment not only exciting but also completely unpredictable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/4.gif?t=1742839923\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes: Easy &amp; Hardcore (No Saves)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're looking for a more relaxed experience, try Easy Mode for a smoother journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But if you're confident you can deliver the pig despite the traps and obstacles, Hardcore Mode is the challenge for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585400?t=1742839923","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585400?t=1742839923","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/5532f2e5aee7ae6e840525f1677786735ad3121b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742839923","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/5532f2e5aee7ae6e840525f1677786735ad3121b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742839923","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Steal the Pig!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As two sneaky thieves, your mission is to steal the pig. But be careful\u2014this pig isn't a fan of traveling! Try not to damage it or let it escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/1.gif?t=1742839923\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer: Team Up to Steal the Pig!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite a trusted friend to your lobby and work together to steal the pig and deliver it safely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/2.gif?t=1742839923\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Traps &amp; Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you'll encounter tricky traps and brain-teasing puzzles that will test your skills and reflexes. Solve challenges and avoid dangers to successfully deliver the pig!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/3.gif?t=1742839923\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Physics at Every Step</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything in this game follows real physics\u2014mass, inertia, collisions\u2014all of it matters! This makes every moment not only exciting but also completely unpredictable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/extras/4.gif?t=1742839923\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes: Easy &amp; Hardcore (No Saves)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're looking for a more relaxed experience, try Easy Mode for a smoother journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But if you're confident you can deliver the pig despite the traps and obstacles, Hardcore Mode is the challenge for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["BAA Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585400/2d9b91fb551b1b6e52113db0979c3089600b15d5/header.jpg?t=1742839923","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257118105,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118105/movie480.mp4?t=1742839920","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118105/movie_max.mp4?t=1742839920"},"name":"Steal The Pig - First Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118105/ce3dc7fa9e513d623f635c3e1d3b4f90533a0461/movie_600x337.jpg